ds (by nick-haoran)\n* fix: Fixed returning to multiplayer rooms after results and room history loading forever after a match (by nick-haoran)\n* fix: Fixed some osu mania custom hit sound / key sound samples not loading according to osu rules (by nick-haoran)\n* fix: Fixed some key sounds looping indefinitely or failing to load due to loop metadata or malformed WAV headers (by nick-haoran)\n* fix: Added a correct osu mania red-line/green-line SV system (by nick-haoran)\nEditor\n* fix: Fixed possible crashes when changing editor grid density or divide during playback (by nick-haoran)\n* fix: Fixed unreleased objects and config listeners after repeated editor/playtest switches causing progressively slower loading (by nick-haoran)", "version": "6.7.12", "wrapperType": "software", "currency": "KRW", "description": "Malody V is a cross-platform music game (Simulator) which is developed by a group of dedicated volunteers. Malody was first relesed in 2014 with Key mode at the beginning. Now it supports Key, Catch, Pad, Ring, Slide, Live and Cube. Each mode has a full featured chart editor and online ranking, also can be played in multiplayer room with friends online.\n\nFeatures:\n* Support variety of chart formats: osu, sm, bms, pms, mc.\n* In game editor, for creating and sharing charts.\n* In game skin editor, make your favorite skin into Malody.\n* Multiplayer, for all mode.\n* Support full keysound chart.\n* Support play recording.\n* Support play effect: random, flip, const, rush, hide, origin, death and more.\n* Support online ranking.\n* Support custom server API.", "averageUserRating": 3, "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/malody-v/id1566873256?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "trackCensoredName": "Malody V", "userRatingCount": 2}]}